            "kind": "REWORK",
            "comments": [
                {
                    "file": "extensions/openpower-pels/registry/message_registry.json",
                    "line": 5869,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Matt Spinler",
                        "email": "spinler@us.ibm.com",
                        "username": "spinler"
                    },
                    "message": "would collecting a portion of the journal be useful here at all?"
                },
                {
                    "file": "extensions/openpower-pels/registry/message_registry.json",
                    "line": 5869,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Adriana Kobylak",
                        "email": "anoo@us.ibm.com",
                        "username": "anoo1"
                    },
                    "message": "No info in the journal or dmesg is generated on IMA events, just in the audit log (/var/log/audit/audit.log), so planning on adding the audit log text in the AdditionalData field of the PEL, example:\n\n```\n\"User Data 1\": {\n...\n    \"RECORD\": \"type=INTEGRITY_DATA msg=audit(1754411921.289:10):\npid=1507 uid=0 auid=1001 ses=1 op=appraise_data\ncause=IMA-signature-required comm=\\\"sh\\\" name=\\\"/tmp/test\\\"\ndev=\\\"tmpfs\\\" ino=17 res=0 errno=0\"\n}\n```"
                },
                {
                    "file": "extensions/openpower-pels/registry/message_registry.json",
                    "line": 5869,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Matt Spinler",
                        "email": "spinler@us.ibm.com",
                        "username": "spinler"
                    },
                    "message": "What would you think of having a 'Notes' section with something that says someone ran an unsigned binary?  or is it supposed to be slightly obfuscated so an attacker couldn't tell that's what the event is for by looking at this file?"
                },
                {
                    "file": "extensions/openpower-pels/registry/message_registry.json",
                    "line": 5869,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Adriana Kobylak",
                        "email": "anoo@us.ibm.com",
                        "username": "anoo1"
                    },
                    "message": "Yeah that's a good idea, will add. It's ok if the attacker knows that we're watching/recording :) , just like logging a 'wrong password' msg."
                },
                {
                    "file": "extensions/openpower-pels/registry/message_registry.json",
                    "line": 5869,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Adriana Kobylak",
                        "email": "anoo@us.ibm.com",
                        "username": "anoo1"
                    },
                    "message": "Done"
                }
            ],
